<body class="worship-page privacy-page"><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>La Davina Emilia</span></a><nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/start-here.php">Start here</a><a href="/who-i-am.php">Who I am</a><a href="/rules.php">Rules</a><a href="/ways-to-worship.php">Ways to Worship</a><a href="/kept-subs.php">Kept</a><a href="/journal-gate.php">Journal</a><a href="/faq.php">FAQ</a><a class="nav-contact" href="/approach.php">Approach me</a></nav></header><main id="main" class="worship-shell"><article class="worship-letter privacy-letter"><div class="worship-celestial" aria-hidden="true"><span class="worship-moon">☾</span><span class="worship-star worship-star-one">✦</span><span class="worship-star worship-star-two">✧</span></div><header class="worship-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A serious note</p><p class="worship-constellation" aria-hidden="true">✦&nbsp;✧&nbsp;✦</p><h1>Discretion &amp; <em>Privacy.</em></h1></header><div class="worship-prose privacy-prose"><p>Short and serious, because this matters more to me than almost anything else on this site.</p><p>Before I was a goddess, I was an engineer. I still am, underneath the ink. I understand security, encryption, data, and digital footprints well enough to know that privacy is built through habits, boundaries, and careful choices—not vague promises.</p><p>What happens between us stays between us. I do not publicly share names, identifying details, or screenshots that identify anyone in my world. Discretion is a two-way street: what you learn about me here stays here too.</p><h2>What that means <em>practically.</em></h2><ul class="privacy-notes"><li>Your survey answers are used to understand your interests, boundaries, and preferred contact details. They are sent to Emilia for review and are not sold or published.</li><li>Share only what is needed for an introduction. Do not submit passwords, financial-account credentials, government IDs, or any information you would not want transmitted by email.</li><li>Photo-album access uses a server-side session. It is a privacy gate, not a substitute for a bespoke identity or CRM system.</li><li>Have a specific privacy need? Say so in your intake. Clear requirements make careful handling possible.</li></ul><p>You have a life. I respect it. As the private onboarding system evolves, this page will be updated to describe its actual protections plainly.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/survey-gate.php">Begin the Intake <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></main><footer class="site-footer"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>La Davina Emilia</span></a><p>Be good. Be curious. Be memorable.</p><div class="social-links"><a href="/faq.php">FAQ</a><a href="/privacy.php">Privacy</a><a href="https://youpay.me/ladavinaemilia" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YouPay.Me</a></div><small>© 2026 La Davina Emilia. All rights reserved.</small></footer></body></html>
